      "description": "Team: Alexa Music\n- Tech lead of active recommended content. Designed and implemented, along with team of 4 engineers, highly scalable solution for providing contextual recommended content on 1P Alexa Multi Modal devices during playback session. Customers get recommendations on the device's screen, interact with them though a rich GUI and select content for playback. Instrumented feature with operational and Business Intelligence metrics. \"Alexa, play music from Amazon Music\" you will see it.\n- Tech lead of Music Discovery Panel. Designed and implemented feature for 1P Alexa Multi Modal devices, allows customers to revisit historical playback sessions to jump back on previous listened content. Swipe left on an Alexa Multi Modal device, tab on the \"Music Note\" icon.",
