      "description": "Team: Alexa Music Multi Modal Experiences\n\nMaking your Alexa Music experience better each day :)\n\n- Tech lead on User Perceived Latency on Alexa Echo devices for the Music experiences. \nInvestigate root causes of latent experiences, troubleshoot and design long-term solutions to reduce latency. Drove improvements on all layers of the experience: device (OS), transportation and asset distribution, backend services and rendering technology. Reduced latency of the overall  Music visual  experience by 1.4 seconds in a year, and there are more improvements to come!!!!\n\n- Alexa Music visual experiences SME\nHelp partner teams (Radio, Podcasts, etc) to onboard on Alexa Music experiences so our customers can get all the benefits and features he have built. Assess designs, logic integration,  long-term strategy for architecture improvements and release plans. Getting the content you love on the platform you have at home.\n\n- Working on the next generation of Alexa Music visual experiences\nWould like to talk more about it but it is secret. What I can tell you is that I am having so much fun working on the project, got exposed to new technologies and has been a great learning curve technology wise and in my career.",
